            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Makes sense.\n\nNevertheless, I would find the ability quite useful, as it can be hard to count how many times a pattern is found between the cursor and your target, and its inconvenient to type 'inf' and 'ilf' repeatedly (just as an example).\n\nYou're a busy person, but if you could imagine how this capability could be hacked together with the existing API, I'd greatly appreciate it. And if I find a hack myself, I'll post it here for future readers.",
