            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> You're a busy person, but if you could imagine how this capability could be hacked together with the existing API, I'd greatly appreciate it. And if I find a hack myself, I'll post it here for future readers.\r\n\r\nGeneral idea I would start looking is to somehow track and cache the latest used keys/function/command and then reuse it in dedicated function/key (`;` in this example).",
