        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Thank you for clarifying.\r\nIf the aim is to adhere to neovim built-in definitions shouldn't `;` then work?\r\n\r\nSo that :\r\n`vaf` + `af`\r\ncould also be executed as:\r\n`vaf` + `;`",
